{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37852","headline":"同友人会裴明府县楼 · 许彬","name":"同友人会裴明府县楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"开阁雨吹尘，陶家揖上宾。\n湖山万叠翠，汀树一行春。\n景逼归檐燕，歌喧已醉身。\n登临兴未足，喜有数年因。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37852.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37852","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}